{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When simplified, the third term in the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca5d67651c36e00205ba5f651cc9bc999592d3cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{a}{\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{a^2})^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"101\" height=\"43\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/b/67bfccfa51192eeb28bc5b873604cf4d91b6fada.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{15}{x}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -\\frac{15}{x}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ -\\frac{6x^2}{a^9} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{20}{a^3}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ -\\frac{20}{a^3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"488\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_Theorem\" title=\"Binomial Theorem\">Binomial Theorem</a>, the third term in the expansion is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/d/27d86fc1cba7609d65121e51bb46b028a63758a3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\binom{6}{2}(\\frac{a}{\\sqrt{x}})^{4}(\\frac{-\\sqrt{x}}{a^2})^2\\]\" width=\"148\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/b/b0bc7984fb145b91aaaf4e4756a3a5ae7af8b35a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[15 \\cdot \\frac{a^4}{x^2} \\cdot \\frac{x}{a^4}\\]\" width=\"84\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/a/d2ad80dbbf439ad927a7a0d25453f342332c5f74.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{15}{x}\\]\" width=\"18\" height=\"37\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/a/c6a8748a2b9ccb5679391254c2c1b9a62f3b33cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u=a/\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"22\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bdb9dfacaf6cdbef9d7751aae33b1f331ef69ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v=-\\sqrt{x}/a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"101\" height=\"22\" />. In the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/1/351e652f3fcef19017136ea0d9e57e90cbdd14ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(u+v)^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"66\" height=\"21\" />, the third term is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/5/3e5967d64999e7a2fb9f66f81b22a913dfe8f4bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom62u^4v^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"79\" height=\"55\" />\nNow\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/2/d22cb348913f931253a870214dc0be9a2b598c33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u^4=\\frac{a^4}{x^2},\\qquad v^2=\\frac{x}{a^4},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"174\" height=\"41\" />\nso the third term equals\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/d/bbdbff8b6b5c3245c1861e32949dce6e083a8de0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\cdot\\frac{a^4}{x^2}\\cdot\\frac{x}{a^4}=\\frac{15}{x}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"141\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td s